[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 23340.19, "timestamp": "06:29:00", "text": "游戏。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23343.07, "timestamp": "06:29:03", "text": "呃，就像就这样过去了，诸如此类。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23347.27, "timestamp": "06:29:07", "text": "东西。忘了。嗯，慢动作"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23350.67, "timestamp": "06:29:10", "text": "还有其他一些东西。你可以双轮行驶所有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23353.83, "timestamp": "06:29:13", "text": "枪支，还有，如果你能杀一个人的话"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23357.03, "timestamp": "06:29:17", "text": "慢动作可以获得更多分数。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23360.468, "timestamp": "06:29:20", "text": "收集物品、金币，你就能打败黑手党。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23363.43, "timestamp": "06:29:23", "text": "或者别的什么。不是Max Pain。哦，对了，麦克斯"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23367.83, "timestamp": "06:29:27", "text": "疼痛也具有缓慢发生的特点。是的。不是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23371.19, "timestamp": "06:29:31", "text": "和托托有关的东西，总而言之"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23375.43, "timestamp": "06:29:35", "text": "一片混乱。不，它叫什么来着？呃，我知道"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23379.31, "timestamp": "06:29:39", "text": "这跟T和P有关。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23392.23, "timestamp": "06:29:52", "text": "墨西哥主题。和呃一起玩的游戏"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23394.59, "timestamp": "06:29:54", "text": "姓名"}]